// src/std/collections/collections.zen
// the folder's public surface: starred re-exports and nothing else.
// Entry and Vec.grow are absent on purpose — `*` is the one gate, so
// Vec travels with add/get/set/take and never with grow or Entry.
//
// each name is both the type and the ufcs constructor `alloc.Vec<T>()`
// calls, because they are one name and travel together.
//
// only str's Eq and Hash impls, and an impl travels with its type
// rather than through a re-export. it is on loan from std.text and
// there is nothing here for it to export.

Vec* = std.collections.collections_vec
Map* = std.collections.collections_map
